        "quote": "(a) Except for properties listed on local, State, or national historic registries, nonresidential design standards in TMC 18.275.050 apply to the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.020:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.020 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "b5ce368c-7e45-5a38-b2ea-85eb4da1946f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 311,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.020:block:1",
          "start": 157
        },
        "quote": "(1) New construction or an alteration to an existing structure which increases or decreases the gross floor area of the structure by more than 50 percent.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.020:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.020 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "6f566d58-07c0-5f3d-8de0-6e54d8082e8b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 435,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.020:block:2",
          "start": 312
        },
        "quote": "(2) Any project requiring a building permit for a remodel of at least 50 percent of the front and/or street-facing facades.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.020:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
