          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.020:block:4",
          "start": 589
        },
        "quote": "(4) Any construction within the O&I-1, O&I-2, O&I-3, C-1, C-2, C-3, C-4, MS-1, I-1, I-2, X-1, X-2, X-3, D-1, D-2, D-3, U-1, and all planned unit development districts for the above-listed use groups.",
