          "start": 1718
        },
        "quote": "(d) Type C building design standards in TMC 18.275.050 apply to I-1, I-2, X-2, and all planned unit development districts for the above-listed use groups, and all developments constructed under the provisions of a conditional use permit in any of these districts.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.020:block:11#text",
